          "id": 92632,
          "content": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular; color: #ffffff; background-color: #ba372a;\"><strong> I. SHADOWING & USEFUL STRUCTURES </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>Check transcript của bài nghe challenge trước tại đây: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18mvPcdldSOCxK4hrN6RkLxn9o03BHLZaIDRwfnBU_rw/edit?usp=sharing\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/18mvPcdldSOCxK4hrN6RkLxn9o03BHLZaIDRwfnBU_rw/edit?usp=sharing\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/18mvPcdldSOCxK4hrN6RkLxn9o03BHLZaIDRwfnBU_rw/edit?usp=sharing</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\"><strong>Học thuộc làu làu tất cả các câu sau (Ghi nhớ nghĩa và Nghe + bắt chước đúng ngữ âm, ngữ điệu và tốc độ)</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">1. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708924843.mp3\" /> How do you like where you're living?</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">2. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708924870.mp3\" /> What's your city like?</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">3. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708924897.mp3\" /> The good thing is there are a lot of things to do here.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">4. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708924924.mp3\" /> The trouble is it's getting very polluted.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">5. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708924949.mp3\" /> The city has a very nice climate. It's never too hot or too cold.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">6. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708924976.mp3\" /> It's very noisy and crowded.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">7. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708925006.mp3\" /> The air is fresh and the people are very friendly.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">8. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708925031.mp3\" /> It's close to the sea, so it's great in the summer.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">9. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708925059.mp3\" /> The subway system is pretty good, too, but it's very old and not very clean.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">10. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708925089.mp3\" /> One thing I do like is that there's very little noise.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">11. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708925136.mp3\" /> It's awfully crowded and the air is so dirty.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">12. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708925163.mp3\" /> It's really a great city, but you have to pay a fortune for everything.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">13. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708925188.mp3\" /> It's pretty and quiet and it isn't dangerous at all.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">14. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708925210.mp3\" /> It has a lot of lovely old buildings and great restaurants.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Nunito-Regular;\">15. <img class=\"audio_custom_need_add_event\" style=\"cursor: pointer; width: 16px;\" src=\"../images/icons8-speaker-40.png\" alt=\"speaker\" height=\"16\" data-url=\"https://api-quiz-maker.langgo.vn/storage/audio/1708925245.mp3\" /> It's easy to get around and everything is very clean.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"> </p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"> </p>",
